bsh-shell (5.12.0-2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Rename source and binary package from bsh to bsh-shell to avoid
    conflict with the legacy Java BeanShell package (bsh).
  * Add Conflicts/Provides/Replaces: bsh so bsh-shell cleanly supersedes it.

